            <circle cx="48" cy="76" r="18" fill="#294b3d"/><circle cx="48" cy="76" r="7" fill="#d9e6d3"/>
            <circle cx="176" cy="76" r="18" fill="#294b3d"/><circle cx="176" cy="76" r="7" fill="#d9e6d3"/>
            <g class="gc-ac" fill="none" stroke="#3b82b8" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M60 28q8-6 16 0t16 0"/><path d="M114 28q8-6 16 0t16 0"/></g>
          </g>
          <g transform="translate(520 100)">
            <rect x="0" y="40" width="140" height="98" fill="#fffdf6" stroke="#294b3d" stroke-width="5"/>
            <path d="M-10 44L70 0L150 44" fill="none" stroke="#294b3d" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <rect x="52" y="58" width="36" height="36" fill="#943d36"/>
            <path d="M70 64V88M58 76H82" stroke="#fffdf6" stroke-width="7"/>
            <rect x="56" y="104" width="28" height="34" fill="#294b3d"/>
          </g>
          <text x="590" y="70" text-anchor="middle">Clínica</text>
          <text x="260" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Aire puesto</text>
        </g>
        <defs><marker id={`${uid}-arrow`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="7" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10Z" fill="#294b3d"/></marker></defs>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="gc-controls" hidden>
      <div class="gc-transport"><button type="button" data-action="prev" aria-label="Paso anterior">←</button><button type="button" data-action="play">Reproducir</button><button type="button" data-action="next" aria-label="Paso siguiente">→</button><button type="button" data-action="restart" aria-label="Volver al primer paso">↺</button></div>
      <p class="gc-position" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    </div>
    <ol class="gc-steps">{steps.map((step, i) => <li data-panel={i}><span class="gc-step-number" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</span><div><h4>{step.title}</h4><p>{step.text}</p></div></li>)}</ol>
    <details class="gc-details"><summary>De dónde sale esta secuencia</summary><p>Resume las recomendaciones de enfriamiento que recoge Hall et al. 2023 (enfriar primero, transportar después; agua sobre piel y pelaje con aire para perros mayores) y el consejo del Colegio de Veterinarios de Madrid. Es una ayuda para actuar mientras llamas, no sustituye las indicaciones de la clínica.</p><p>La reproducción avanza sola cada pocos segundos y puedes pausarla cuando quieras. Con movimiento reducido, recorre los pasos con las flechas.</p></details>
  </div> : <div data-gc-umbrales data-zone="1">
    <header><p class="gc-kicker">Temperatura máxima del aire prevista para el día</p><h3 id={`${uid}-title`} data-toc-exclude="true">Tu perro mayor va por delante del aviso amarillo</h3><p>La guía del Ministerio marca el peligro para perros de edad avanzada antes de que la AEMET emita el primer aviso.</p></header>
    <div class="gc-zones" role="group" aria-label="Zona de ejemplo de la AEMET" hidden>
      {zones.map((zone, i) => <button type="button" data-zone-index={i} data-threshold={zone.threshold} data-name={zone.name} aria-pressed={i === 1 ? 'true' : 'false'}><span>{zone.name}</span><strong>{zone.threshold} °C</strong></button>)}
    </div>
    <div class="gc-scale" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="gc-bar"></div>
      <div class="gc-gap" style={`left:${pct(30)}`}></div>
      <div class="gc-range" style={`left:${pct(34)};width:calc(${pct(38)} - ${pct(34)})`}></div>
      <span class="gc-mark gc-mark-ministerio" style={`left:${pct(30)}`}><span>30</span></span>
      <span class="gc-mark gc-mark-todos" style={`left:${pct(32)}`}><span>32</span></span>
      <span class="gc-mark gc-mark-aviso" style={`left:${pct(36)}`}><span>36</span></span>
      <div class="gc-ticks">{ticks.map(t => <span style={`left:${pct(t)}`}>{t}°</span>)}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="gc-readout" aria-live="polite">Según la zona, el aviso amarillo por temperatura máxima empieza a 34, 36 o 38 °C. Ejemplos: Sierra de Madrid 34 °C, Metropolitana y Henares 36 °C, Campiña sevillana 38 °C.</p>
    <ul class="gc-legend">
      <li class="gc-legend-ministerio"><strong>30 °C</strong><span>Guía del Ministerio: ya puede ser peligroso para perros grandes, de edad avanzada o braquicéfalos.</span></li>
      <li class="gc-legend-todos"><strong>32 °C</strong><span>Guía del Ministerio: riesgo alto de golpe de calor para todos los perros.</span></li>
      <li class="gc-legend-aviso"><strong>34–38 °C</strong><span>AEMET: primer aviso amarillo por temperatura máxima, según tu zona.</span></li>
    </ul>
    <details class="gc-details"><summary>Cómo leer esta comparación</summary><p>Las dos referencias son temperaturas del aire. Las del Ministerio vienen de su guía para olas de calor (2024); las de la AEMET, del anexo de umbrales del Plan Meteoalerta (2022). Comprueba el umbral vigente de tu zona en la web de la AEMET.</p><p>Los avisos de la AEMET son generales y no están pensados para animales. La humedad, el esfuerzo y la salud de tu perro también cuentan: obsérvalo aunque el termómetro marque menos.</p></details>
  </div>}
</section>

<script>
  class GolpeCalorSequence {
    private step = 0;
    private playing = false;
    private timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;
    private events = new AbortController();
    private reduced = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
    private readonly last = 3;
    constructor(private root: HTMLElement) {
      root.dataset.enhanced = 'true';
      root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.gc-controls')!.hidden = false;
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const action = button.dataset.action;
        if (action === 'play') {
          if (this.playing) this.stop();
          else if (!this.reduced.matches) {
            if (this.step === this.last) this.step = 0;
            this.playing = true;
            this.render();
            this.schedule();
          }
        } else {
          this.stop();
          if (action === 'restart') this.step = 0;
          else this.step = Math.max(0, Math.min(this.last, this.step + (action === 'next' ? 1 : -1)));
          this.render();
        }
      }, { signal: this.events.signal }));
      this.reduced.addEventListener('change', this.preference, { signal: this.events.signal });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', this.visibility, { signal: this.events.signal });
      window.addEventListener('pagehide', this.stop, { signal: this.events.signal });
      this.preference();
    }
    private preference = () => {
      this.stop();
      this.root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action="play"]')!.disabled = this.reduced.matches;
    };
    private visibility = () => { if (document.hidden) this.stop(); };
    private stop = () => { clearTimeout(this.timer); this.timer = undefined; this.playing = false; this.render(); };
    private schedule() {
      clearTimeout(this.timer);
      this.timer = setTimeout(() => {
        if (!this.root.isConnected || !this.playing) { this.stop(); return; }
        if (this.step < this.last) { this.step++; this.render(); this.schedule(); }
        else this.stop();
      }, 5500);
    }
    private render() {
      this.root.dataset.step = String(this.step);
      this.root.dataset.playing = String(this.playing);
      this.root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-panel]').forEach((panel, i) => panel.dataset.active = String(i === this.step));
      const position = this.root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.gc-position')!;
      position.setAttribute('aria-live', this.playing ? 'off' : 'polite');
      position.textContent = this.reduced.matches ? `Paso ${this.step + 1} de 4 · movimiento reducido: usa las flechas` : `Paso ${this.step + 1} de 4`;
      this.root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action="prev"]')!.disabled = this.step === 0;
      this.root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action="next"]')!.disabled = this.step === this.last;
      this.root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action="play"]')!.textContent = this.playing ? 'Pausar' : this.step === this.last ? 'Reproducir de nuevo' : 'Reproducir';
    }
    disconnect() { this.stop(); this.events.abort(); }
  }

  const MIN = 26;
  const MAX = 40;
  const pct = (t: number) => `${((t - MIN) / (MAX - MIN)) * 100}%`;
  function setupUmbrales(root: HTMLElement): AbortController {
    const events = new AbortController();
    root.dataset.enhanced = 'true';
    const group = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.gc-zones')!;
    group.hidden = false;
    const buttons = [...group.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button')];
    const select = (button: HTMLButtonElement) => {
      const threshold = Number(button.dataset.threshold);
      buttons.forEach(b => b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b === button)));
      root.style.setProperty('--gc-aviso', pct(threshold));
      root.style.setProperty('--gc-gap', `calc(${pct(threshold)} - ${pct(30)})`);
      root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.gc-mark-aviso span')!.textContent = String(threshold);
      root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.gc-readout')!.textContent = `${button.dataset.name}: el aviso amarillo empieza a ${threshold} °C, ${threshold - 30} grados por encima de la referencia del Ministerio para perros de edad avanzada.`;
    };
    buttons.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => select(button), { signal: events.signal }));
    select(buttons.find(b => b.getAttribute('aria-pressed') === 'true') ?? buttons[0]);
    return events;
  }

  const sequences = new Map<HTMLElement, GolpeCalorSequence>();
  const umbrales = new Map<HTMLElement, AbortController>();
  function initializeGolpeCalor() {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-gc-sequence]').forEach(root => { if (!sequences.has(root)) sequences.set(root, new GolpeCalorSequence(root)); });
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-gc-umbrales]').forEach(root => { if (!umbrales.has(root)) umbrales.set(root, setupUmbrales(root)); });
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => {
    sequences.forEach(instance => instance.disconnect());
    sequences.clear();
    umbrales.forEach(events => events.abort());
    umbrales.clear();
  });
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initializeGolpeCalor);
  initializeGolpeCalor();
</script>

<style>
  .gc-visual { margin:2.1rem 0; padding:1.35rem; color:#294b3d; background:#fffdf6; border:1px solid #bccbb7; border-radius:1.1rem; font-family:system-ui,sans-serif; max-width:46rem; }
  .gc-visual header { margin:0 0 .9rem; }
  .gc-visual .gc-kicker { margin:0 0 .45rem; color:#4b6249; font-size:.72rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.5; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .gc-visual h3 { color:#294b3d!important; font-size:clamp(1.15rem,3vw,1.5rem); line-height:1.3; margin:0 0 .45rem!important; }
  .gc-visual h4 { color:#294b3d!important; font-size:1rem; line-height:1.4; margin:0 0 .2rem; }
  .gc-visual p { color:#36533e; margin:.4rem 0; font-size:.94rem; line-height:1.6; }
  .gc-visual strong { color:#294b3d!important; }
  .gc-visual [hidden] { display:none!important; }
  .gc-visual li::before,.gc-visual li::marker { content:none!important; display:none!important; }
  .gc-visual :is(button,summary):focus-visible { outline:3px solid #89551c; outline-offset:3px; }
  .gc-visual .gc-details { background:#fffdf6!important; border-color:#bccbb7!important; border-radius:.7rem!important; padding:.65rem .8rem!important; margin:.75rem 0 0!important; }
  .gc-visual .gc-details summary { color:#294b3d!important; min-height:44px; font:650 .85rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif!important; gap:.75rem; }
  .gc-visual .gc-details summary::after { color:#294b3d!important; }
  .gc-visual .gc-details p { font-size:.83rem; }
  .gc-visual button { min-width:44px; min-height:44px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #7d9671; border-radius:.55rem; background:#fffdf6; color:#294b3d; padding:.55rem .7rem; font:650 .85rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif; cursor:pointer; }
  .gc-visual button:disabled { color:#4b6146; background:#e6eddf; border-color:#a3b397; cursor:default; }

  .gc-canvas { background:#edf2e8; border-radius:.75rem; overflow:hidden; }
  .gc-canvas svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
  .gc-canvas text { fill:#294b3d; font:700 26px system-ui,sans-serif; }
  .gc-scene { opacity:0; }
  [data-step="0"] [data-scene="0"],[data-step="1"] [data-scene="1"],[data-step="2"] [data-scene="2"],[data-step="3"] [data-scene="3"] { opacity:1; }
  [data-gc-sequence]:not([data-enhanced]) [data-scene="0"] { opacity:1; }
  [data-playing="true"] .gc-scene { transition:opacity .6s ease; }
  .gc-blades { transform-origin:0 0; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="0"] .gc-ring { animation:gc-ring 1.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="0"] .gc-sun { animation:gc-sun 5.5s ease forwards; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="1"] .gc-drops { animation:gc-drops 1.4s linear infinite; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="2"] .gc-blades { animation:gc-spin .9s linear infinite; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="2"] .gc-air { animation:gc-flow 1.2s linear infinite; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="2"] .gc-vapor { animation:gc-vapor 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="3"] .gc-road { animation:gc-flow .8s linear infinite; }
  [data-playing="true"] [data-scene="3"] .gc-ac { animation:gc-ring 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes gc-ring { 0%,100% { opacity:.25; } 50% { opacity:1; } }
  @keyframes gc-sun { from { opacity:1; } to { opacity:.35; } }
  @keyframes gc-drops { from { transform:translateY(-30px); opacity:0; } 20% { opacity:1; } to { transform:translateY(120px); opacity:.2; } }
  @keyframes gc-spin { to { transform:rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes gc-flow { to { stroke-dashoffset:-84; } }
  @keyframes gc-vapor { 0% { transform:translateY(0); opacity:0; } 40% { opacity:.9; } 100% { transform:translateY(-40px); opacity:0; } }

  .gc-controls { margin:.6rem 0 .2rem; }
  .gc-transport { display:flex; gap:.45rem; }
  .gc-visual [data-action="play"] { flex:1; background:#294b3d; color:#fff; }
  .gc-visual [data-action="play"]:disabled { color:#4b6146; background:#e6eddf; }
  .gc-visual .gc-position { margin:.35rem 0 0; font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700; }
  .gc-steps { list-style:none; padding:0!important; margin:.5rem 0!important; }
  .gc-steps li { display:flex; gap:.7rem; margin:0!important; padding:.45rem 0; }
  .gc-step-number { display:grid; place-items:center; width:2rem; height:2rem; flex:0 0 2rem; background:#294b3d; color:#fff; border-radius:50%; font-size:.85rem; font-weight:700; }
  .gc-steps p { margin:0; font-size:.9rem; }
  [data-enhanced="true"] .gc-steps [data-active="false"] { display:none; }

